<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NuCo2 Inc raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NuCo2 Inc raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James Financial said it raised its recommendation on NuCo2 Inc to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 13-1/4 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
